You shatter your weapon in the ground, projecting a psionic shockwave in a cone of radius [3, 4, 4, 5, 6 (TL1-5)].

Any foes in the area will take [124%, 143%, 157%, 169%, 180% (TL1-5)] weapon damage as mind damage.

Any psionic clones hit will instantly shatter, exploding for [108, 146, 175, 200, 222 (TL1-5; SP 100)] physical damage in radius 1.

If you do not have a two handed weapon equiped, but have it in your off set, you instantly automatically switch.
